      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I generally like this Idea, especially if a group has a portion of its audience that's under 18 an a majority that's over 18.\n\nAn example scenario could be aimed towards allowing those who are Age V. squirrel themselves away in a specific private room in an event venue when the conversation turns adult or if the Age V. person doesn't feel interested in being around minors at that time.\n\nThis could also be used to help keep tally on how many are Age V. vs. how many aren't in an instance, though that could also just be a UI feature that just shows the Age V. symbol next to a number.",
